OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FJordan has intercepted five missiles
OL,7,Flaunched from Iran after the US said
OL,8,Fit had shot down a barrage of Iranian
OL,9,Fmissiles fired at American forces in
OL,10,Fthe Middle East.
OL,12,FThe Jordanian military said early on
OL,13,FMonday that the missiles had been
OL,14,F"intercepted and destroyed".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
