PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FIran's state-run IRNA news agency
OL,7,Freported that the Revolutionary
OL,8,FGuard's Aerospace Force had fired
OL,9,Fballistic missiles at Muwaffaq Salti
OL,10,FAir Base and the headquarters of the
OL,11,FUS military's Central Command in
OL,12,FJordan.
OL,14,FHours earlier, US Central Command said
OL,15,Fits forces "remain vigilant and at a
OL,16,Fhigh state of readiness" and had also
OL,17,Fworked with Saudi forces to strike
OL,18,Fsites in Iraq used by Iran-backed
OL,19,Fmilitias to launch attacks in recent
OL,20,Fdays.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
