FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FIn announcing the strikes in Iraq, the
OL,7,FUS warned that further attacks on
OL,8,FAmerican troops or Saudi Arabia's
OL,9,Fenergy infrastructure could produce
OL,10,Fadditional military action.
OL,12,FThe US and Iran had experienced a
OL,13,Fbrief period of calm, with neither
OL,14,Fside announcing attacks for around
OL,15,Fthree days following weeks of
OL,16,Fescalating tensions over the strategic
OL,17,FStrait of Hormuz, the narrow waterway
OL,18,Fthrough which around 20% of the
OL,19,Fworld's traded oil normally passes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FThe latest fighting comes after a
OL,7,Fmonth of mounting pressure on US
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,10,FFour American troops have been killed
OL,11,Fin recent weeks, while the Pentagon
OL,12,Fhas asked an increasingly sceptical
OL,13,FCongress for additional funding to
OL,14,Fcover the growing cost of the conflict.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
