FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,F"US and Saudi fighter aircraft struck
OL,7,Fmultiple terrorist logistics and
OL,8,Fweapons sites across eastern Iraq in a
OL,9,Fstrong response to over 30 IRGC-
OL,10,Fdirected aerial drone attacks in the
OL,11,Flast 72 hours," US Central Command
OL,12,Fsaid, using an acronym for Iran's
OL,13,Fparamilitary Revolutionary Guard.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
