FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FThe Saudi Defence Ministry
OL,7,Facknowledged the strikes in a post on
OL,8,Fsocial media, warning that "the
OL,9,FKingdom emphasises that it does not
OL,10,Fseek escalation but will respond to
OL,11,Fany aggression it faces."
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Israeli Prime Minister
OL,14,FBenjamin Netanyahu said he had an
OL,15,F"excellent" meeting with Trump at the
OL,16,FWhite House on Tuesday, their first
OL,17,Fface-to-face talks since launching a
OL,18,Fjoint war against Iran.
OL,26,@pD@\OUsD@YO]wD@AOUwD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785338294
OL,3,CUS-Saudi strike Iraq after 'surprise'
OL,4,CIran attack as tensions flare
OL,6,FThe meeting came as both leaders face
OL,7,Fgrowing domestic pressure. Netanyahu
OL,8,Fis preparing for an election while
OL,9,Ffacing criticism, including over his
OL,10,Fdeteriorating relationship with Trump.
OL,12,FTrump is under pressure to end an
OL,13,Funpopular war that has caused economic
OL,14,Fdisruption and pushed up prices ahead
OL,15,Fof the US midterm elections in
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
